Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:46:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 36/48] elden: arm64/clk: sm8750 platform plumbing for Y700
 Gen4

split from h0cheung/tb322fc-linux-kernel 0001 arm64: qcom: add Lenovo
Legion Tab Y700 Gen4 support; folds in 0067 (q6apm/q6prm GPR source
port from DT) for the sm8750.dtsi service@3/@7 nodes
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi          |  330 ++-
 drivers/clk/clk.c                             |   69 +-
 drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc-sm8750.c              |    4 +-
 drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sm8750.c                 |    3 +
 drivers/clk/qcom/gdsc.c                       |   19 +
 drivers/clk/qcom/gdsc.h                       |    2 +
 7 files changed, 2867 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi
index b82a16652..68ace5fd4 100644
